26	/**
27	 * App tile logo. Prefers the Simple Icons brand glyph (rendered inline on a light
28	 * chip so both light and dark marks read on the dark UI), and falls back to the
29	 * shared AppLogo — which itself resolves a bundled /public/logos SVG or a tasteful
